WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:12.600
The Pilgrims founded Plymouth Plantation in
December 1620

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.660
and promptly commenced to get sick and die.

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:20.360
When the settlers finally stopped croaking,
they set about creating a Heaven on Earth.

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:25.520
A society without private property where all
worked for the common good.

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:30.280
Everything was shared, especially bitching
and moaning about working for the common good.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:35.860
Let's let the colony's leader, William Bradford,
tell it:

00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:05.740
And it wasn't just the menfolk who found the
situation unbearable.

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:23.060
With nobody working, everybody was suffering.

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:26.540
And in case you think nobody was working simply
because they couldn't understand

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:29.840
a damn thing Bradford was saying: chew on this.

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:33.000
In 1623 Bradford and the other leaders...

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:55.680
In no time at all:

00:02:02.179 --> 00:02:05.729
America would never go hungry again.

00:02:05.729 --> 00:02:10.449
So this week, before you drift into your annual
tryptophan induced coma,

00:02:10.449 --> 00:02:14.800
don't forget to give thanks to the true patron of this holiday feast:

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:16.600
Property Rights.

